OL,3,GNEWSAFatal crash driver handed
OL,4,Acommunity payback order
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who caused the death of a
OL,7,Fwoman in a head-on collision on the A75
OL,8,Fin southern Scotland has been given a
OL,9,Fcommunity payback order.
OL,11,FMary Reeves, 67, of Kirkcudbright, died
OL,12,Fas a result of the crash on the road
OL,13,Fbetween Castle Douglas and Bridge of
OL,14,FDee in May 2025.
OL,16,FCameron Benson, 20, of Castle Douglas,
OL,17,Fhad previously admitted a careless
OL,18,Fdriving charge at Dumfries Sheriff
OL,19,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
